To handle exceptions gracefully, this solution logs any encountered errors and continues with the next file in the batch. This helps to prevent individual file validations from affecting the overall processing and ensures that detailed error logs are generated.

In terms of maintainability, this solution is designed to be easily extensible and configurable, allowing for the addition of new validation rules and handling of different file types without significant changes. The use of a thread pool also makes it easier to scale up or down the processing capacity as needed, which can help to improve performance and resource utilization over time.

Overall, this solution balances efficiency, usability, maintainability, and scalability by using a thread pool for parallel processing, dynamically loading validation rules, and handling exceptions gracefully.

