The `Monitor` class is responsible for monitoring the system resources of the octree and adjusting the partitioning strategy as needed to avoid running out of memory or slowing down the query performance. It uses a set of heuristics to determine when to split the tree, when to merge nodes, and when to rebalance the tree.
