The class is resilient against various error scenarios, including invalid input lengths, missing or expired tokens, and network issues during token retrieval. It also implements padding oracle protection to secure against attacks exploiting incorrect keys or IVs. The class provides detailed error messages and logging for debugging and monitoring purposes, including token refreshes, cache hits, and decryption attempts.

