The function starts by checking if the request is a bulk update from a single source IP within a short time frame, which helps prevent potential DDoS attacks and abuse. If so, it returns an error message. Otherwise, it begins a transaction and updates multiple clinics in a single statement to minimize the risk of partial updates.

