In this example, we have implemented a rate limiter to prevent excessive API calls. We have also added encryption and secure storage of tokens using the `DecryptAccessToken` function.

Note that in a real-world scenario, you would need to implement your own logic for checking access token validity and decrypting encrypted access tokens. The example above is just a demonstration of how these features can be integrated with the API client.

